  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Verified Spin-Field Samples\n\nConcrete bosonized checks for the repaired `psi-psi-S` and `psi-psi-psi-S` projected OPEs.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
