  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "probeSample3 = probeProjectedOPESamples[\n  \"Holo\",\n  0,\n  OPEProjected[0, 0][R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z1], \\[Psi][mu, 0, z1]], R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z2], \\[Psi][nu, 0, z2]], R[S[{alpha, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z3]]],\n  {mu, nu},\n  {alpha, \"chiral\"},\n  Function[{vecs, spin}, {\n    R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z1], \\[Psi][vecs[[1]], 0, z1]],\n    R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z2], \\[Psi][vecs[[2]], 0, z2]],\n    R[S[{spin, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z3]]\n  }],\n  3,\n  40,\n  20260409\n];\n\ntest3 = testReport[\"Probe Test 3 (psi-psi-S concrete probes all match)\", probeSample3[\"PassQ\"]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
